n\",\"Description\":\"Create calendar integration utilities for Google Calendar and iCal/ICS download\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/lib/calendar.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating calendar utilities\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create src/lib/calendar.ts\"}"
