  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Components**\n\nI\'m now building the initial components, starting with the Navbar. I\'m focusing on making it a sticky top bar with smooth scrolling features. I\'m also including a mobile menu drawer and quick actions. Next up is the Hero component, where I\'ll integrate the names H\341\272\243i Nam & Kh\303\241nh Linh, alongside some romantic banner imagery.\n\n\n**Designing the Story**\n\nI\'m now designing the \"Our Story\" component, aiming for an interactive vertical timeline. I\'m focusing on animated entrances and visually appealing milestone cards. Each card will have a date, photo, title, story description, and location tag. I\'m also planning clean, unboxed metadata with bullet separators. The target is a clean, modern design.\n\n\n**Adding Event Details**\n\nI\'m now adding event details, including time, dates, venue name and address for both the l\341\273\205 gia ti\303\252n and ti\341\273\207c c\306\260\341\273\233i events. I\'ll embed a Google Map and include options to add to Google Calendar or download an iCal file.\n\n\n**Implementing Guestbook & Gifts**\n\nI\'m now implementing the Guestbook component, focusing on the form for guest messages. This will allow guests to submit messages directly to Supabase with error handling, loading spinners, and confetti on success! I\'m also including a \"Like\" button with a heart-flying animation, and the messages will show up in order of the newest messages. Following this, I\'m integrating the GiftBox component, displaying the couple\'s VietQR codes, bank account details, and names.\n\n\n**Integrating Audio & Support**\n\nI\'m now integrating the audio player with a romantic soundtrack, including a floating widget with a spinning vinyl record visual. I\'m also including copy-to-clipboard buttons and thank you notes from both families. Lastly, I\'m making sure to add a modal to help others integrate their Supabase keys. This should give users an easier way to check their setup without needing to rebuild.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_417744"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState, useEffect } from \'react\';\\nimport { Heart, Menu, X, Database, Music, Volume2, VolumeX } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { getSupabaseConfig } from \'../lib/supabase\';\\n\\ninterface NavbarProps {\\n  onOpenSupabaseModal: () => void;\\n  isPlayingMusic: boolean;\\n  onToggleMusic: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Navbar: React.FC<NavbarProps> = ({\\n  onOpenSupabaseModal,\\n  isPlayingMusic,\\n  onToggleMusic\\n}) => {\\n  const [isScrolled, setIsScrolled] = useState(false);\\n  const [mobileMenuOpen, setMobileMenuOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const supabaseConfig = getSupabaseConfig();\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const handleScroll = () => {\\n      setIsScrolled(window.scrollY > 40);\\n    };\\n    window.addEventListener(\'scroll\', handleScroll, { passive: true });\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'scroll\', handleScroll);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const navLinks = [\\n    { label: \'C\303\242u Chuy\341\273\207n\', href: \'#story\' },\\n    { label: \'Thi\341\273\207p M\341\273\235i\', href: \'#invitation\' },\\n    { label: \'Album \341\272\242nh\', href: \'#gallery\' },\\n    { label: \'X\303\241c Nh\341\272\255n\', href: \'#rsvp\' },\\n    { label: \'S\341\273\225 L\306\260u B\303\272t\', href: \'#guestbook\' },\\n    { label: \'M\341\273\253ng C\306\260\341\273\233i\', href: \'#gift\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  const handleLinkClick = (e: React.MouseEvent<HTMLAnchorElement>, href: string) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    setMobileMenuOpen(false);\\n    const element = document.querySelector(href);\\n    if (element) {\\n      element.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header\\n      className={`fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 transition-all duration-300 ${\\n        isScrolled\\n          ? \'bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md shadow-xs border-b border-stone-200/60 py-3\'\\n          : \'bg-gradient-to-b from-stone-900/60 via-stone-900/20 to-transparent py-4 text-white\'\\n      }`}\\n    >\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n        {/* Zone 1: Single text element wordmark */}\\n        <a\\n          href=\\\"#hero\\\"\\n          onClick={(e) => handleLinkClick(e, \'#hero\')}\\n          className={`font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors ${\\n            isScrolled ? \'text-stone-900 hover:text-rose-700\' : \'text-white hover:text-rose-200\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <span>Nam</span>\\n          <Heart className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-rose-500 text-rose-500 inline-block animate-pulse\\\" />\\n          <span>Linh</span>\\n        </a>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: 4-6 clean text navigation links */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 lg:gap-8\\\">\\n          {navLinks.map((link) => (\\n            <a\\n              key={link.href}\\n              href={link.href}\\n              onClick={(e) => handleLinkClick(e, link.href)}\\n              className={`text-sm tracking-wide transition-colors relative py-1 hover:text-rose-600 ${\\n                isScrolled ? \'text-stone-600 font-medium\' : \'text-stone-100/90 font-medium drop-shadow-xs\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              {link.label}\\n            </a>\\n          ))}\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: 1-2 primary actions */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3\\\">\\n          {/* Music Quick Toggle */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onToggleMusic}\\n            aria-label=\\\"B\341\272\255t/T\341\272\257t nh\341\272\241c n\341\273\201n\\\"\\n            className={`p-2 rounded-full transition-colors flex items-center justify-center ${\\n              isScrolled\\n                ? \'bg-stone-100 text-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-200\'\\n                : \'bg-white/20 text-white backdrop-blur-xs hover:bg-white/30\'\\n            }`}\\n            title={isPlayingMusic ? \'T\341\272\241m d\341\273\253ng nh\341\272\241c n\341\273\201n\' : \'Ph\303\241t nh\341\272\241c n\341\273\201n\'}\\n          >\\n            {isPlayingMusic ? <Volume2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 animate-pulse\\\" /> : <VolumeX className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Database Setup Modal Trigger */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenSupabaseModal}\\n            className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n              isScrolled\\n                ? \'border border-stone-200 text-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-50\'\\n                : \'border border-white/30 text-white hover:bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs\'\\n            }`}\\n            title=\\\"C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i Supabase\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Database className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-500\\\" />\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">\\n              {supabaseConfig.isConfigured ? \'Supabase Live\' : \'Supabase SQL\'}\\n            </span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Primary Action Button */}\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#rsvp\\\"\\n            onClick={(e) => handleLinkClick(e, \'#rsvp\')}\\n            className=\\\"px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-white bg-rose-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-rose-700 transition-colors shadow-xs whitespace-nowrap active:scale-95\\\"\\n          >\\n            X\303\241c Nh\341\272\255n Tham D\341\273\261\\n          </a>\\n\\n          {/* Mobile hamburger button */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen(!mobileMenuOpen)}\\n            className={`md:hidden p-2 rounded-lg transition-colors ${\\n              isScrolled ? \'text-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-100\' : \'text-white hover:bg-white/10\'\\n            }`}\\n            aria-label=\\\"M\341\273\237 menu\\\"\\n          >\\n            {mobileMenuOpen ? <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" /> : <Menu className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile dropdown drawer */}\\n      {mobileMenuOpen && (\\n        <div className=\\\"md:hidden bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-lg border-b border-stone-200 px-4 pt-3 pb-6 shadow-xl animate-in slide-in-from-top duration-200\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-3\\\">\\n            {navLinks.map((link) => (\\n              <a\\n                key={link.href}\\n                href={link.href}\\n                onClick={(e) => handleLinkClick(e, link.href)}\\n                className=\\\"text-stone-700 hover:text-rose-600 font-medium py-2 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-stone-50 transition-colors text-base\\\"\\n              >\\n                {link.label}\\n              </a>\\n            ))}\\n            <div className=\\\"pt-2 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  setMobileMenuOpen(false);\\n                  onOpenSupabaseModal();\\n                }}\\n                className=\\\"flex-1 py-2 px-3 text-xs font-medium border border-stone-200 text-stone-700 rounded-md hover:bg-stone-50 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n              >\\n                <Database className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-600\\\" />\\n                C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh Supabase\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={onToggleMusic}\\n                className=\\\"py-2 px-4 text-xs font-medium bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 rounded-md hover:bg-rose-100 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n              >\\n                <Music className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                {isPlayingMusic ? \'T\341\272\257t nh\341\272\241c\' : \'B\341\272\255t nh\341\272\241c\'}\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create Navbar component following 3-zone Top Bar Contract and responsive mobile menu\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Navbar.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating Navbar component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create src/components/Navbar.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 722919051
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    provider_assigned_message_id: "rdW7apq9C-2hz7IP_qWm0QM"
  }
}
