 `${delay}ms`,\n        transitionTimingFunction: \'cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)\',\n      }}\n      className={`transition-all ${getAnimationClass()} ${className}`}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n"
