  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Cross-Requests**\n\nI\'m now cross-referencing requests 4 and 2 to ensure consistency across components. I\'m focusing on incorporating scroll-triggered animations (from request 2) with the background images (from request 4) to create a cohesive user experience. The linked image resource is being utilized as reference for visual integration.\n\n\n**Integrating Visuals & Animations**\n\nI\'m now integrating the scenic background images with the `ScrollReveal` animations for each component. I\'m focusing on \"Story,\" \"Invitation,\" \"RSVPForm,\" and \"Guestbook.\" I\'m prioritizing romantic, golden-hour aesthetics with gentle scrims and watercolor elements for \"Story,\" elegant banquet halls for \"Invitation,\" candlelit receptions for \"RSVPForm,\" and festive fairy lights for \"Guestbook.\" Each component will use unique reveal animations for its elements.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_372226"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Heart, MapPin, Sparkles } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { StoryMilestone } from \'../types/wedding\';\\nimport { ScrollReveal } from \'./ScrollReveal\';\\n\\ninterface StoryProps {\\n  milestones: StoryMilestone[];\\n}\\n\\nexport const Story: React.FC<StoryProps> = ({ milestones }) => {\\n  return (\\n    <section id=\\\"story\\\" className=\\\"relative py-24 sm:py-32 px-4 sm:px-6 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      {/* Scenic Background with Soft Romantic Ambient Scrim */}\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n        <img\\n          src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518495973542-4542c06a5843?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80\\\"\\n          alt=\\\"Story background\\\"\\n          referrerPolicy=\\\"no-referrer\\\"\\n          className=\\\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center filter blur-[2px] opacity-15\\\"\\n        />\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FAF8F5] via-[#FAF8F5]/90 to-[#FAF8F5]\\\" />\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto\\\">\\n        {/* Section Header with ScrollReveal */}\\n        <ScrollReveal animation=\\\"fade-up\\\" duration={700}>\\n          <div className=\\\"text-center mb-16 sm:mb-20\\\">\\n            <p className=\\\"font-script text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-rose-600 mb-1\\\">\\n              Our Journey\\n            </p>\\n            <h2 className=\\\"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight text-balance\\\">\\n              Chuy\341\273\207n Ch\303\272ng M\303\254nh\\n            </h2>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"h-px w-12 bg-rose-300\\\" />\\n              <Heart className=\\\"w-4 h-4 fill-rose-500 text-rose-500\\\" />\\n              <div className=\\\"h-px w-12 bg-rose-300\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-600 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              T\341\273\253ng b\306\260\341\273\233c ch\303\242n qua n\304\203m th\303\241ng, t\341\273\253 nh\341\273\257ng ng\303\240y \304\221\341\272\247u b\341\273\241 ng\341\273\241 \304\221\341\272\277n l\341\273\235i h\341\272\271n \306\260\341\273\233c tr\341\273\215n \304\221\341\273\235i. D\306\260\341\273\233i \304\221\303\242y l\303\240 nh\341\273\257ng c\341\273\231t m\341\273\221c ng\341\273\215t ng\303\240o nh\341\272\245t tr\303\252n h\303\240nh tr\303\254nh ch\303\272ng m\303\254nh c\303\271ng nhau b\306\260\341\273\233c qua.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </ScrollReveal>\\n\\n        {/* Timeline Container */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          {/* Central Vertical Line */}\\n          <div \\n            aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" \\n            className=\\\"absolute left-6 md:left-1/2 top-4 bottom-8 -translate-x-1/2 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-rose-200 via-rose-300 to-rose-200\\\" \\n          />\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-12 sm:space-y-16\\\">\\n            {milestones.map((item, index) => {\\n              const isEven = index % 2 === 0;\\n\\n              return (\\n                <div\\n                  key={item.id}\\n                  className=\\\"relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center group\\\"\\n                >\\n                  {/* Timeline node icon */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"absolute left-6 md:left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-rose-500 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-rose-600 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-rose-50 transition-transform duration-300\\\">\\n                    <Sparkles className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Content Card Layout with Alternating Slide Animation */}\\n                  <div\\n                    className={`w-full md:w-1/2 pl-14 md:pl-0 ${\\n                      isEven\\n                        ? \'md:pr-12 md:text-right\'\\n                        : \'md:pl-12 md:ml-auto md:text-left\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <ScrollReveal\\n                      animation={isEven ? \'fade-right\' : \'fade-left\'}\\n                      delay={100}\\n                      duration={650}\\n                    >\\n                      <div className=\\\"bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\\\">\\n                        {/* Media Thumbnail with Fallback */}\\n                        <div className=\\\"relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-stone-100 aspect-16/9 shadow-inner\\\">\\n                          <img\\n                            src={item.imageUrl}\\n                            alt={item.imageAlt}\\n                            referrerPolicy=\\\"no-referrer\\\"\\n                            loading=\\\"lazy\\\"\\n                            className=\\\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out\\\"\\n                            onError={(e) => {\\n                              const target = e.currentTarget;\\n                              target.style.display = \'none\';\\n                              const parent = target.parentElement;\\n                              if (parent) {\\n                                parent.className += \' flex items-center justify-center bg-rose-50/50 text-rose-400 p-6\';\\n                                parent.innerHTML = `\\n                                  <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n                                    <span class=\\\"text-xs font-serif uppercase tracking-widest text-rose-700\\\">${item.title}</span>\\n                                    <p class=\\\"text-xs text-stone-400 mt-1\\\">${item.date}</p>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                `;\\n                              }\\n                            }}\\n                          />\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        {/* Metadata Header - Clean Unboxed Text */}\\n                        <div\\n                          className={`flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-rose-700 font-semibold tracking-wider mb-2 ${\\n                            isEven ? \'md:justify-end\' : \'justify-start\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        >\\n                          <span>{item.year}</span>\\n                          <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"text-stone-500 font-normal\\\">{item.date}</span>\\n                          {item.location && (\\n                            <>\\n                              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                              <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 text-stone-500 font-normal\\\">\\n                                <MapPin className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-rose-500\\\" />\\n                                {item.location}\\n                              </span>\\n                            </>\\n                          )}\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        {/* Title */}\\n                        <h3 className=\\\"font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2\\\">\\n                          {item.title}\\n                        </h3>\\n\\n                        {/* Description */}\\n                        <p className=\\\"text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                          {item.description}\\n                        </p>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </ScrollReveal>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Add scenic background and ScrollReveal animations to Story timeline\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Story.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating Story component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Add background image and scroll animations to Story.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
