  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Hero.tsx**\n\nI\'m thinking about updating `src/components/Hero.tsx`. I envision a visually striking banner, drawing inspiration from that Unsplash image. I\'m aiming for a bright, joyful, and sun-kissed atmosphere, using a wedding couple amidst blooming florals. It needs to feel natural and inviting, a perfect introduction.\n\n\n**Refining Hero Banner**\n\nI\'ve been iterating on the banner\'s visual style for `Hero.tsx`. The current direction involves a frosted glass countdown card rendered beautifully in morning light, using a combination of backdrop-blur and border effects for a high-end feel. I\'m exploring gradients and overlays to achieve a bright, cheerful aesthetic for the action buttons, considering `bg-gradient-to-r` styles with rose tints. The countdown numbers will be prominent with color variations!\n\n\n"
